---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="about-container">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img src="/images/profile.jpg" alt="Melanie Song portrait" />
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">
    
      <h1 class="about-title">Hello Again!</h1>
      <p>
        I'm Melanie Song, a Master's student in Human-Centered Design &
        Engineering at the University of Washington.

      </p>

      <p>
        My path to UX design wasn't a straight line - it was shaped by curiosity,
        a love for problem-solving, and a belief that small details can create
        big impact. With a background in finance and data science, and experience 
        working as a wearer of many hats (like business analyst and product manager), 
        I’m comfortable thinking across both user and business perspectives.
      </p>

      <p>
        Along the way, I discovered that what excites me most is understanding how 
        people think, what frustrates them, and how thoughtful design can make their 
        lives easier. Now, I focus on creating experiences that feel intuitive and 
        purposeful, blending research with creativity to solve real problems.
      </p>

      <p>
        Outside of design, you'll find me in the kitchen testing new recipes, 
        hanging out with my mini goldendoodle, or working through puzzles when 
        I need a moment to reset. I'm always eager to collaborate, learn from 
        others, and create work that makes a meaningful difference.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
